type: software
title: "AI-RLWHF: AI-assisted reinforcement learning with honesty and feedback"
abstract: "AI-RLWHF is an open, experimentation-first workspace for Transformer Lab plugins and reinforcement learning workflows that reward honesty, feedback capture and multi-model collaboration. It began as a research spinoff of Knowledge3D."
authors:
